OL,3,GNEWSAFormer MI6 spy takes Trump to
OL,4,AScottish court for #800,000 legal
OL,5,Apayout
OL,6,
OL,7,FA company founded by a former spy is
OL,8,Fpursuing Donald Trump at a small
OL,9,FScottish court for more than #800,000
OL,10,Fin unpaid legal costs.
OL,12,FThe US president was named in a hearing
OL,13,Fat Ayr Sheriff Court as Orbis Business
OL,14,FIntelligence seeks funds from the Trump
OL,15,FTurnberry golf resort.
OL,17,FThe case concerns legal costs owed by
OL,18,FTrump from a 2024 English data
OL,19,Fprotection case against Orbis's
OL,20,Fdirector Christopher Steele - a former
OL,21,FMI6 agent.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
